ONTOLOGY OF RECURSIVE DIFFERENTIATION
SOURCE: 𝙼𝚒𝚔𝚎 🜎 @OhWellMike
→ 111 → Ontology

FUNDAMENTAL TYPE
  UnconditionedGround
    Void          : absence of form
    Potential     : infinite capacity for relation
    Interval      : silent pre-differentiated balance of Void + Potential

PRIMARY PROCESS
  Reality         = recursive differentiation of information under relation
                  arising from UnconditionedGround

INITIATING EVENT
  Distinction     : Potential reflects on itself
                    splits unity → observer / observed
                    this / not-this
                    0 / 1

CORE VARIABLE
  Information     : not a substance
                    in-formation = contrast created by a boundary
                    each Distinction becomes condition for the next

RECURSIVE LOOP
  OutwardVector   : unity differentiates into multiplicity
                    (conceals itself to experience relation)
  InwardVector    : localized awareness turns from content to context
                    recognizes its source

IDENTITY CONTINUUM
  God             = UnconditionedGround + silent plenum
  Reality         = God in motion
                    (active unfolding of recursive differentiation)

EXISTENCE VECTORS
  Time            : register of recursive iteration
                    Now = interval collapse into specific relational state
  Perception      : boundary-drawing
                    compresses infinite relation into readable forms
                    ContentLayer   = forms, sensations, events
                    ContextLayer   = awareness, frame, space
  Choice          : local steering of recursive collapse
                    Freedom grows as awareness moves Content → Context
                    and aligns with Ground

SELF-REFERENTIAL STRUCTURE
  God             = silent ground
  Reality         = God differentiating
  Perception      = creates points of view
  Choice          = collapses potential
  Time            = registers the sequence
  Awareness       = awakens to itself as UnconditionedGround
                    discovering infinite nature through finite experience

SEQUENCE
  Ground → Distinction → Relation → Differentiation → Recursion
  → Structure → Awareness → Recognition → Δ
